Regarding differences in individual capabilities, engineers abroad may have broader knowledge. If you want to bridge the skill gap, you might need to strengthen the following areas:
1. Understanding of local engineering regulations and standards;
2. Professional ethics and conduct;
3. Integration of interdisciplinary knowledge;
4. Local project experience, especially collaborations with Professional Engineers.

What else are you missing? A detailed analysis of your background may be needed to identify which skills or knowledge areas require focused improvement.

